      "message": "perf(studio): retain accessible pages and reconcile modal state\n\nKeep unchanged page content separate from modal inputs using the pinned\nretained backend, which replays accessibility nodes and action listeners.\nReconcile modal layers on owner-state changes so Cancel removes the shell\nas well as its content instead of depending on another cached render.\n\nLocal checks and native modal regression pass. One fixed-order background\npair measured UI CPU 6.70% to 2.82% of one core; foreground and final release\ngates remain pending. Core source and business data are unchanged.\n\nCo-authored-by: Codex <codex@openai.com>",
